  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-03-23T06:47:45.336Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Use the green screen in any world with post processing. \n\n(Hey, would it be possible to have a button to disable all post processing when using the camera?  It would make video production easier and most of that is better handled in post for many situations.  At least as an option it would be very useful)",
